<title>USA: WPPSS $117 mln bonds repriced and restructured.</title>
<headline>WPPSS $117 mln bonds repriced and restructured.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Monday it repriced and restructured Washington Public Power Supply System's $116.6 million project one refunding bonds, adjusting yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2017 unchanged at 5.82 percent.</p>
<p>WASHINGTON PUBLIC POWER SUPPLY SYSTEM</p>
<p>RE: $116,630,000*</p>
<p>NUCLEAR PROJECT NO 1</p>
<p>REFUNDING REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996C1</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD BASED ON THE FOLLOWING.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT WILL BE CLOSED.</p>
